      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "This is a limitation of the Unity engine as noted here: https://discussions.unity.com/t/variable-rate-shading-and-directstorage/921244/2\n\nIt would require a wrapper or plugin developed separately for use and would not be much more performant due to how VRChat currently manages asset loading. This feature also would not retain platform compatibility with Mobile and Quest platforms in the codebase.",
